      "writtenOn": "2026-02-21T07:35:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027re concerned about the overall binary size, so Tint is relevant.\n\nIt seemed to me that Tint could just as well have multi-line blocks of MSL or HLSL code embedded in it - though I did notice I didn\u0027t find any when doing this. Is there an architectural reason that wouldn\u0027t happen?",
      "parentUuid": "6aed5a2a_081a58b8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 398,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 399,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "2fe1667ccb986ed61e35dc7c0acd7a78b3466dbe",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b2b284fd_e254dab2",
        "filename": "PRESUBMIT.py",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 399,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000257
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-22T17:46:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is no architectual reason it wouldn\u0027t happen, just usually the longest strings we make are validation strings.\n\nThat said, if we wanted to use this in Tint we\u0027d need to move it out of src/dawn and into src/utils so it could be shared.",
      "parentUuid": "4d452060_4102a52d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 398,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 399,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "2fe1667ccb986ed61e35dc7c0acd7a78b3466dbe",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "225f8ba2_d909190f",
        "filename": "PRESUBMIT.py",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 399,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002241
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-23T17:48:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s unlikely to happen since we try and represent everything in Tint IR where possible.\n\nWhen it does happen, it uses our own `Line()` helper for buffering output, which looks like this:\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/refs/tags/147.0.7700.2:third_party/dawn/src/tint/lang/msl/writer/printer/printer.cc;l\u003d210-218",
      "parentUuid": "b2b284fd_e254dab2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 398,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 399,
